{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vm1kre5g","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":310,"top":174,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"能从语言中判断谁更像在隐瞒身份；多是两类判断。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ul83i9ob","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":66,"top":281,"width":240,"height":57},"text":"长对话研究","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#00539B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/90z2p4nq","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":310,"top":281,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"证明前后发言和游戏进展有用，但研究的游戏规则不同。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
