{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/orylgj2p","slideIndex":5,"position":{"left":310,"top":388,"width":735,"height":67},"text":"重点让模型学会参与游戏；我们重点判断所有人的身份。","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":26,"typeface":"微软雅黑","color":"#111111","alignment":"left"}}
